## 2. Conventions

| Marker | Meaning | Allowed action |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `[verified]` | has `file:line`, reproducible here | may only be downgraded, never invented |
| `[inferred]` | follows from code or data, not executed | may be upgraded after execution, with a record |
| `[unverified]` | must be confirmed in the real environment | only a real run removes it |

- Every page ≤ `limits.default`; index / inventory / troubleshooting pages ≤ `limits.index` (exemptions live in `tools/audit.config.json`).
- A section ≤ `section_max_lines`; tables over prose; relative links.
- Never silently upgrade a marker; never write commit hashes.
- Old whole pages go to `_archive/`; **they are never an entry**.

